## Quiz Application
Build a quiz with questions, scoring and a results screen.

## Dependencies
- Flutter SDK only

## Steps
1. Model questions with options and answer index
2. Show one question at a time
3. Track score
4. Results screen with retry

```dart
class Question {
  const Question(this.text, this.options, this.answer);
  final String text;
  final List<String> options;
  final int answer;
}
int score(List<Question> qs, List<int> picks) => [for (var i = 0; i < qs.length; i++) if (qs[i].answer == picks[i]) 1].length;
```

