## Chat Application
Build a real-time chat with Firestore streams.

## Dependencies
- cloud_firestore
- firebase_auth

## Steps
1. Messages collection per room
2. StreamBuilder for messages
3. Send with a TextField
4. Show own messages on the right

```dart
import 'package:cloud_firestore/cloud_firestore.dart';

Stream<QuerySnapshot<Map<String, dynamic>>> messages(String room) => FirebaseFirestore.instance
    .collection('rooms/$room/messages').orderBy('sentAt').snapshots();
```

## Testing
Write a unit test for the core logic and a widget test that taps the main action and checks the result.

## Summary
- You built a working chat application.
