@lesson projects-m01-l15 | Complete Production-Style Flutter Application | 45
## Learning objectives
- Build a complete complete production-style flutter application
- Practise architecture, state and testing

## Complete Production-Style Flutter Application
Combine everything: feature-based architecture, routing, state management, networking, local cache, theming, tests, CI and a release build.

## Dependencies
- go_router
- flutter_riverpod
- dio
- drift
- flutter_test

## Steps
1. Define features and layers
2. Set up routing and DI
3. Implement data layer with cache
4. Build screens with loading/error states
5. Add tests and CI
6. Build and sign a release

```dart
// lib/
//   app/ (router, theme)
//   core/ (network, storage, errors)
//   features/<feature>/{data,domain,presentation}
void main() {}
```

## Testing
Write a unit test for the core logic and a widget test that taps the main action and checks the result.

## Summary
- You built a working complete production-style flutter application.
- Extend it with your own features.
